From ab85a9bf58392c5c08b6c055247d51880eb07aee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LPFchan <me@lost.plus>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:24:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 01/17] Quantize Inkling's BF16 attention and head projections
 to NVFP4 at load (TF_INKLING_FP4)

TF_INKLING_FP4=attn keeps Q, K, V, R, gate and O as NVFP4 lane weights; =all adds the output head.
Router, sink and conv projections stay BF16. Each tensor is quantized on the device at load: one
fp32 scale, an e4m3 scale per 16 inputs picked by squared error among five candidates, then packed
by modelopt_pack. Decode rows take the qmmf lane, prompt rows the NVFP4 prompt GEMM.

Spark pair, greedy decode: 16.3 -> 22.3 tok/s with all; load time unchanged; 8K needle passes.
